1
00:00:02,752 --> 00:00:04,422
(Leonard:)Okay.

2
00:00:05,255 --> 00:00:07,255
The X Tens are online.

3
00:00:07,424 --> 00:00:13,384
(Howard:)Gentlemen, I am now about to send a signal
from this laptop through our local ISP...

4
00:00:13,555 --> 00:00:17,015
...racing down fiber-optic cable
at the speed of light to San Francisco...

5
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:20,523
(Howard:)...bouncing off a satellite in
geosynchronous orbit to Lisbon, Portugal.

6
00:00:20,687 --> 00:00:23,817
(Howard:)Data packets will be handed off
to submerged transatlantic cables...

7
00:00:23,982 --> 00:00:25,902
...terminating in Halifax, Nova Scotia...

8
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:29,737
(Howard:)...and transferred across the continent
via microwave relays back to our ISP...

9
00:00:29,904 --> 00:00:32,114
...and the external receiver attached
to this...

10
00:00:33,116 --> 00:00:34,536
(Scene:)...lamp.

11
00:00:36,995 --> 00:00:39,165
(Sheldon:)Look at me, look at me,
I've got goose bumps.

12
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:42,250
- Are we ready on the stereo?
- Go for stereo.

13
00:00:43,168 --> 00:00:44,208
[MOUSE CLICKS]

14
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:47,377
[2001: A SPACE ODYSSEY'S "MAIN TITLE"
PLAYS OVER SPEAKERS]

15
00:00:50,341 --> 00:00:52,341
[LEONARD HUMMING]

16
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:55,762
[ALL HUMMING]

17
00:00:57,307 --> 00:01:03,027
[ALL IMITATING DRUMS]

